1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,762
Bagaimana Jerman menaklukkan Prancis hanya dalam enam

2
00:00:02,734 --> 00:00:03,267
minggu?

3
00:00:03,273 --> 00:00:04,021
Jawabannya:

4
00:00:04,059 --> 00:00:05,698
Blitzkrieg, perang kilat.

5
00:00:05,681 --> 00:00:08,448
Sebelumnya, Perang Dunia Pertama macet di parit.

6
00:00:08,448 --> 00:00:10,924
Empat tahun, garis depan nyaris tak bergerak.

7
00:00:11,006 --> 00:00:12,059
Jerman belajar.

8
00:00:12,031 --> 00:00:15,293
Heinz Guderian dan rekan-rekannya memadukan tank, pesawat,

9
00:00:15,265 --> 00:00:17,600
dan radio, untuk menghantam cepat di satu

10
00:00:17,572 --> 00:00:17,933
titik.

11
00:00:17,951 --> 00:00:20,489
September, seribu sembilan ratus tiga puluh sembilan.

12
00:00:20,456 --> 00:00:21,565
Polandia diserang.

13
00:00:21,656 --> 00:00:24,955
Stuka menghantam dari udara, panzer menerobos pertahanan.

14
00:00:24,964 --> 00:00:27,661
Mei tahun berikutnya, panzer melintasi hutan Ardennes

15
00:00:27,634 --> 00:00:30,240
yang dianggap mustahil, memutari Garis Maginot.

16
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,675
Sekutu terkepung di Dunkirk, dan Paris jatuh

17
00:00:32,647 --> 00:00:33,715
pada empat belas Juni.

18
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:36,009
Tapi di Uni Soviet, kilat itu padam.

19
00:00:35,952 --> 00:00:38,994
Wilayahnya terlalu luas, logistik kewalahan, dan musim

20
00:00:38,966 --> 00:00:39,911
dingin datang.

21
00:00:39,829 --> 00:00:40,650
Pelajarannya:

22
00:00:40,641 --> 00:00:43,605
kecepatan bisa memenangkan pertempuran, tapi belum tentu

23
00:00:43,577 --> 00:00:44,614
memenangkan perang.
